otengine/godot/issues/104186","id":2727058894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ii53O","user":{"login":"JulianHeuser","id":25406449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDA2NDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25406449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser","html_url":"https://github.com/JulianHeuser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T23:41:07Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T23:41:07Z","body":"I found the environment variable: `DISABLE_VK_LAYER_VALVE_steam_overlay_1`, which does technically fix it, but only by turning off the overlay and game recording, which isn't a solution at all for games releasing on Steam. The editor itself has the overlay already disabled for the steam version, so this isn't an issue there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727058894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729503325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104186#issuecomment-2729503325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godo