855928","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104186#issuecomment-2729855928","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104186","id":2729855928,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6itku4","user":{"login":"JulianHeuser","id":25406449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDA2NDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25406449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser","html_url":"https://github.com/JulianHeuser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JulianHeuser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T15:01:31Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T15:01:31Z","body":"I can't find anything else that would affect it, I am on an AMD card and the Windows machine was Intel, which might be a factor?\n\nI made a dev build of the build template and got a better stack trace though, hopefully it helps:\n```\n================================================================\nhandle_crash: Program crashed with signal 11\nEngine version: Godot Engine v4.5.dev.custom_build (4ef0cd689ffe41ffa8d21cd3028816e75ef74502)\nDumping the backtrace. Please include this when reporting the bug to the project developer.\n[1] /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6(+0x45330) [0x7731f7845330] (??:0)\n[2] /home/julian/.local/share/Steam/ubuntu12_64/gameoverlayrenderer.so(+0x36d64) [0x7731f7ca7d64] (??:0)\